Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:00:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] test(golden): refresh the google wire snapshot for
 sentinel signatures

`46ad0ff15` makes every unsigned functionCall part carry Google's documented
`skip_thought_signature_validator` sentinel, so each google-wire turn grows by
one sentinel per call (+54 bytes/turn in this fixture) and both the wire sha
and the persisted state digest move with it. `storage-engine-proofs` compares
the same rendering, hence the paired update.

Regenerated with `node --import tsx scripts/update-storage-render-goldens.ts`;
chat/anthropic/responses snapshots are untouched.
---
 tests/golden/storage-render/google.json | 96 ++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 48 insertions(+), 48 deletions(-)

